    "description": "The Support Ticket History Retrieval API provides users with access to historical data about support tickets associated with their accounts. By utilizing this API, consumers can extract details of previously submitted tickets, including their statuses, resolutions, and timestamps. This feature is particularly useful for customer support teams or account managers who need to analyze past interactions to improve service quality or address recurring issues. With an intuitive design, this endpoint simplifies the process of tracking and managing support ticket histories.",
